### Testar XP System Reestruturado

### 1. Login para obter token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

@token = {{ login.response.body.access_token }}

###

### 2. Ver perfil inicial (deve mostrar level 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Ver estado inicial da fazenda
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Plantar trigo no terreno 0
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "wheat"
}

### 5. Esperar 30 segundos e colher (deve ganhar XP e coins)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

### 6. Ver perfil após colheita (deve mostrar XP e level atualizado)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Repetir plantio/colheita para testar level up
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "wheat"
}

### 8. Colher novamente
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}
